tial tests)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (RunDiffTests, BuildBinary, DiffTest pattern)\n      - pkg/sys/ (InstallSIGPIPEHandler, Stat, Lstat)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/cp/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add functionality for srd056-cp R3.1 through R3.4\n      - path: cmd/cp/cp_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential test cases covering R3.1 through R3.4\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement the functionality specified by srd056-cp requirement R3.1\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement the functionality specified by srd056-cp requirement R3.2\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement the functionality specified by srd056-cp requirement R3.3\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement the functionality specified by srd056-cp requirement R3.4\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Extend the existing cmd/cp implementation -- do not rewrite or restructure code from R1.1-R2.4\n      - id: D2\n        text: Use testutils.RunDiffTests with gcp as the reference binary for all new differential tests\n      - id: D3\n        text: Skip differential tests with t.Skip if gcp is not found via exec.LookPath\n      - id: D4\n        text: Set LC_ALL=C in test environment to match GNU reference binary behavior\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: go build -o bin/cp ./cmd/cp/ succeeds with no errors\n      - id: AC2\n        text: go vet ./cmd/cp/... reports no issues\n      - id: AC3\n        text: go test ./cmd/cp/... -count=1 passes (or skips if reference binary not found)\n      - id: AC4\n        text: Each of R3.1 through R3.4 has at least one differential test case in cp_test.go\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"cmd/cp: srd056 R4.1-R4.4\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd056-cp.yaml (requirements R4.1 through R4.4)\n      - cmd/cp/main.go (existing implementation covering R1.1-R3.4)\